OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold start, with frost in
OL,6,Fsome inland spots. Patchy cloud around
OL,7,Ffor the south during the morning, but
OL,8,Fgenerally a very sunny, dry day.
OL,9,FFeeling chilly, with temperatures
OL,10,Fbelow the seasonal average, especially
OL,11,Faround breezy northern coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA dry night ahead with plenty
OL,14,Fof clear spells. Temperatures will
OL,15,Ffall sharply overnight beneath long
OL,16,Fclear spells as winds ease. A
OL,17,Fwidespread frost is expected,
OL,18,Fparticularly in sheltered valleys.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
