OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA cloudy start in the
OL,6,Fnorthwest, where there will be a few
OL,7,Fscattered showers throughout the day.
OL,8,FDry and sunny in the south and further
OL,9,Feast. Another chilly day.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,12,Fand dry on Saturday, then cloudier on
OL,13,FSunday and Monday with patchy rain and
OL,14,Fshowers. Feeling cold with
OL,15,Ftemperatures remaining below average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
